WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[MUSIC]

00:00:14.159 --> 00:00:18.420
We study consumers interactions when
sharing the pursuit of the same goal.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:24.100
Customers initially joined these programs
to work on goals they value and

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.390
to seek companionship from others who are
pursuing the same goal.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:33.380
As a result these consumers felt close and
shared helpful tips among the group.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.710
However, we felt that this companionship
does not last forever.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:44.420
Once people got near their goal and felt
more certain about their ability to pursue

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:49.490
this goal themselves, they stopped being
friends and stopped sharing information.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.980
For example, we found that Weight
Watchers' members who were

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:58.070
successfully losing weight started sitting
at the back of the room.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.550
Refuse to participate in discussions.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:04.960
Stop sharing their experiences or dropped
out of the program altogether.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.760
One solution for marketers in the
organizations is to emphasize to

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.260
consumers the uncertainty in how to
approach the goal.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.200
To test this solution.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.750
We designed a seven day walking program
and found that when participants felt

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:26.040
that they were pursuing the walking goal
for different reasons then their partner.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:29.340
They felt less certain about how to
approach this goal.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:32.470
And consequently stayed friendly, helpful,
and

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:34.830
shared tips until the end of the program.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.390
Therefore, if we could make people feel
that they are still unsure about how

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.530
to lose weight.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.180
The best way to quit smoking, or how to
earn more frequent flyer mileage,

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:50.919
we can foster companionship and facilitate
knowledge exchange among consumers.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.050
This way knowledge, information, and

00:01:55.050 --> 00:02:00.010
tools that can help consumers attend their
goals will be shared more widely.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.250
After all, we're all in the same boat.

